>What uses has unholy water ?
>
 If you have a chaotic character and you quaff it, you'll get the
message '...you feel quite proud with yourself.'

 I also remember in an older version of Hack, if you throw a poition
of unholy water upon some type of undead, like a ghost, it improves
the Hit Points of that creature. It also goes the other way, if you
throw a potion of Holy water on an undead creature, it will hurt them.
I think that is a waste of holy water though. I still like how you can
generate lots of holy water. All you need is one potion of holy water.
Next you get a whole bunch of useless potions and dilute them in fountains
untill them become non-cursed potions of water. You arrange them so
they all fall under on letter in your pack order. You then dip all of 
them into the one potion of Holy Water, and all of the potions of water
become Holy Water. I think its pretty cool dipping 6 potions of water
into one vial of Holy water and you copme out with 6 potions of Holy
Water. Good deal!

